# Copy to cre/.env and fill in. NEVER commit cre/.env (ignored via cre/.gitignore).
#
# Raw 64-hex-char private key, no 0x prefix. The CRE simulator requires it to
# initialise even for dry runs; with --broadcast it must hold Arc Testnet gas.
CRE_ETH_PRIVATE_KEY=YOUR_64_CHARACTER_PRIVATE_KEY_HERE

# Optional: headless auth instead of `cre login` (created in the Chainlink
# Platform UI, Organization -> API Keys). Leave unset to use `cre login`.
# CRE_API_KEY=
